URL:https://newbraunfels.gov/recycling
DESCRIPTION:Free for New Braunfels residents. Bring a photo ID and a curren
 t NBU or GVEC utility bill. One load per household: up to 5 large items an
 d 4 rimless car tires. No trailers at city sites\, no mattresses at the NB
 U Service Center. No electronics\, appliances\, yard waste or construction
  debris. Check the city's listing for the final site list before you go.\n
 https://newbraunfels.gov/recycling
